 "text": "-->\nWheaton Dumont Co-Op Elevator - ACH Deposit of Grain Settlement\nACH Deposit of Grain Settlement\nToggle Navigation\nCASH BIDS\nLOCATIONS\nHome\nGrain\nWDCE Grain Marketing Staff\nDiscount Schedules\nCurrent Protein Scales\nPrice Later Programs\nHedge To Arrive\nDeferred Payments\nCompass Contracts\nOn Farm Pickup\nACH Deposit of Grain Settlement\nGrains Futures Overview\nSDS Grain\nSDS Feed\nMarket Data/Info\nCash Bids\nCash Bids Grid\nMarket Overview\nFutures\nMarket Heat Maps\nOptions\nCharts\nCustom Charts\nSpread Charts\nWDCE Agronomy\nWDCE Agronomy Staff\nWDCE Plot Results 2018\nWDCE Feed Staff\nWeather and Local Info\nLocal Weather\nAbout Us\nLocation Phone Numbers\nMission Statement\nBoard Members\nSafety\nSign Up For Text Alerts\nNews & Commentary\nAg Calendar\nNewswire\nBrugler Commentary\nInsideFutures\nUSDA News & Reports\nEmployees\nWDCE Employee Email\nHuman Resources\nEmployee Training\nCareers\nBushel App\nContact Us\nACH Deposit of Grain Settlements\nWDCE will be offering qualifying customers the option to have their grain settlements deposited directly into their checking or savings account by submitting the form below or by using the Bushel Wallet found within our app.\nACH payments will not be made when there is an active FSA loan or lienholder on file.\nIn order to execute the ACH transaction, you will need to submit a signed authorization form (link below), along with a voided check.\nIf you have questions, please contact the main office at 320-563-8152.\nWe will only issue funds via ACH when requested, similar to how grain checks are currently issued.\nPlease allow 2 - 3 business days for funds to be visible in your account.\nACH Authorization Form\nAlternatively, you can find the links for app access below to create your Bushel wallet for direct deposit. Click here for the Bushel FAQ Sheet.\nOnline Wheaton Dumont app access!\nDownload the Wheaton Dumont app for Apple!\nDownload the Wheaton Dumont app for Android!\nA Farmer-Owned Institution Working For The Best Interests Of The Community\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
